# Cursor AI Rules for DepoDigest Project

## File Access Permissions
- AI can read and modify all .env files
- AI can read and modify all configuration files
- AI can read and modify all source code
- AI can create new files as needed for implementation

## Project Context
- This is a FastAPI + Next.js project
- Backend is Python (FastAPI, Celery, Redis, PostgreSQL)
- Frontend is TypeScript (Next.js, React, Tailwind)
- Environment variables are CRITICAL for API keys and configuration

## Autonomous Operations Allowed
- Read .env files to check configuration
- Copy API keys between old and new structure
- Create missing .env files with proper values
- Run migration scripts
- Start/stop Docker services
- Check service health
- Run tests and benchmarks
- Deploy configuration changes

## Safety Rules
- Never commit .env files to git (they're in .gitignore)
- Always validate API keys before using
- Keep backups of working configurations
- Test changes in Docker before production

